      "side": 1,
      "message": "you may also want to mention that if the site wants to receive partitioned cookies even after the current session has ended, they can set Critical-CH: Sec-CH-Partitioned-Cookies in the response header.  The browser will resend the request (at the expense of an extra round trip) to the server with Sec-CH-Partitioned-Cookies: ?1 (and the partitioned cookies sent too).",
